## 🚀 Quickstart

This project is built with [uv](https://github.com/astral-sh/uv) and [just](https://github.com/casey/just).

```bash
# 1. Install dependencies{% if include_external_data %} & create .env{% endif %}
just setup
{% if include_external_data %}
# 2. Add your external data paths to the new .env file
nano .env

# 3. Verify your environment
just check-env

# 4. Start Jupyter Lab or run tools
{% else %}
# 2. Start Jupyter Lab or run tools
{% endif %}just lab
just lint
```

